B.aM3=new A.l4("dashcn add","dashcn add --help","dashcn add <component|block|flow:flow...> [flags]","Installs the transitive closure of every requested id:","Usage: dashcn add <component|block|flow:flow...> [flags]\n       dashcn add --all [--blocks] [flags]\n\nInstalls the transitive closure of every requested id:\ncomponents, blocks, flows, primitives, and the always-on foundation/theme core.\nA block installs to blocks/<id>/ with the components it uses.\nA flow installs to flows/<id>/ with the components and blocks it uses (dashcn add flow:<id>).\n\nOptions:\n  --all               Install every component in the registry\n  --blocks            With --all, install every block too\n  --dry-run           Print the plan without writing anything\n  --force             Overwrite locally modified registry files\n  --include-preview   Also copy each component preview.dart\n  --package           Depend on the dashcn package, copy no sources\n  --path <dir>        With --package, use a path dependency instead\n  --json              Machine-readable output on stdout\n  --help, -h          Show this message",B.bLo)
